#, php-format
msgid "If this is on, uninstalling also erases this site's identity. The paid license attached to this site cannot be restored automatically afterwards; you would have to contact Babilim support at %s to get it back."
msgstr "If dis one dey on, to uninstall go also erase dis site identity. Dem no fit restore di paid license wey dey attach to dis site automatically after dat; you go need contact Babilim support for %s to get am back."

