msgstr[0] "%1$d site for dis network dey set to erase im Babilim identity when dem delete di plugin. Dem no go fit restore di paid license wey dey attach to dat site automatically; you go need contact Babilim support for %2$s. To keep di identity, press Cancel, untick \"Delete all Babilim data on uninstall\" for dat site Babilim settings, then deactivate again. Deactivate anyway?"
msgstr[1] "%1$d sites for dis network dey set to erase dia Babilim identity when dem delete di plugin. Dem no go fit restore di paid license wey dey attach to dose sites automatically; you go need contact Babilim support for %2$s. To keep di identities, press Cancel, untick \"Delete all Babilim data on uninstall\" for each site Babilim settings, then deactivate again. Deactivate anyway?"

#. translators: %s: Babilim support email address. Do not translate or change it.
#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:1709
#, php-format
msgid "This network has too many sites to check them one by one, and some of them may be set to erase their Babilim identity when the plugin is deleted. The paid license attached to such a site could then not be restored automatically; you would have to contact Babilim support at %s. To keep the identities, press Cancel, untick \"Delete all Babilim data on uninstall\" in each site's Babilim settings, and deactivate again. Deactivate anyway?"
msgstr "Dis network get too many sites to check dem one by one, and some of dem fit don set make dem delete dia Babilim identity when dem delete di plugin. Di paid license wey connect to such site no go fit restore by itself; you go need contact Babilim support for %s. To keep di identity dem, press Cancel, untick \"Delete all Babilim data when you uninstall am\" for each site Babilim settings, then deactivate again. Deactivate anyway?"

