msgstr "Babilim no fit verify dis site, so nothing go download or install."

#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:1815
msgid "The service could not reach your site. A firewall, security plugin or host rule is probably blocking the request; please allow requests to /wp-json/babilim/v1/challenge."
msgstr "Di service no fit reach your site. Maybe firewall, security plugin or host rule dey block di request; abeg allow requests to /wp-json/babilim/v1/challenge."

